lines=['# Peru — expansion research, 15 November 2026','','**5 institutions returned actual books: 4 selected university systems and 1 specialist reserve. The selected-ten goal is short by 6.** The major institutional sweep is documented below, including policy restrictions, challenges and failed routes. No app changes or integrations were made.','','Use the existing Koha adapter as a candidate for UNCP, UNSCH and UNSA, subject to template and access-policy review. UNSM needs a Quibuk adapter. The SNB public union has the strongest potential municipal reach, but its API returned an explicit access denial. The four-university Consorcio is another promising route whose currently discovered Enterprise/Primo search origins disallow automated access.','','## Marketplace and access','','Peru has a national heritage/reading-room institution, municipal libraries coordinated through the SNB, large university systems and specialized research libraries. BNP reports7.5million mixed bibliographic/documentary materials, not lending books. Its Colección Peruana is reading-room consultation with registration/DNI. The municipal initiative reported40new libraries in15regions in2025; that is infrastructure, not evidence of40 searchable holdings in the new union. [BNP size]('+sources[0]['url']+') · [Municipal expansion]('+sources[13]['url']+') · [BNP room use]('+sources[18]['url']+').','','Koha is the best evidenced reusable family in this sample: actual results at UNCP, UNSCH, UNSA and MALI, plus restrictive/failed installations at UNI, USMP, UNSAAC and others. The2021 SNB project explicitly included Koha support. PUCP uses a SirsiDynix Enterprise public form; historical UNMSM evidence identifies Symphony. BCRP procurement and the2025 ExLibris Peru event support Alma/Primo adoption. UNA Puno exposes PMB; BNP exposes AbsysNet; official UNALM evidence names Sophia; UNSM exposes Quibuk. These are deployment observations, **not market-share estimates**. UPeU illustrates why current evidence matters: its historical page says Symphony but current robots identifies Koha. [SNB project]('+sources[12]['url']+') · [BCRP]('+sources[15]['url']+') · [ExLibris meeting]('+sources[16]['url']+') · [UNALM]('+sources[4]['url']+').','','The Consorcio shared-search announcement covers PUCP, Pacífico, Lima and UPCH. No returned ownership from those institutions was obtained, so it yields zero verified targets here. University repositories, ALICIA results and subscribed ebook platforms are separate from physical holdings. [Consorcio announcement]('+sources[14]['url']+').','','## Major size-informed priorities','','These12 priorities preserve large blocked institutions. Mixed materials, combined print/electronic totals, dates and institutional proxies cannot establish a national size ranking.','','|Institution|Size or explicit proxy|Observed outcome|','|---|---|---|']
for n,s,u,o in priorities:lines.append(f'|[{n}]({u})|{s}|{o}|')
